      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that there are grants, but applying for them is a nightmare and most small owners don't even have the staff to handle the paperwork. honestly, it feels like the government is just prioritizing green optics over the reality of keeping local businesses alive. do you think the climate benefits actually justify the risk of driving small manufacturers out of business?",
